---
// 首页轻量预约横幅：保留 /#pricing 锚点（旧外链兼容），实际预约在 /booking
---
<section id="pricing" class="container-wide my-16">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 md:px-8">
    <div class="bg-black rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl tracking-tighter font-bold text-white">需要一组照片？</h2>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-zinc-300">
          人像 / 活动 / 旅行跟拍，套餐价格、拍摄流程与须知都在预约页。
        </p>
      </div>
      <a
        href="/booking"
        class="rounded-full px-4 border py-2 text-sm font-semibold transition-all flex items-center justify-between bg-white text-gray-500 h-10 border-gray-300 hover:bg-zinc-100 duration-200 w-auto whitespace-nowrap"
        >前往预约页 <span>&rarr;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
